\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:833be3b9-9492-4c28-aee4-21c64af4e675\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Filro\" title=\"Filro\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Portrait_Filro.png/25px-Portrait_Filro.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Portrait_Filro.png/38px-Portrait_Filro.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/29/Portrait_Filro.png/50px-Portrait_Filro.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Filro the Forgotten\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/29/Portrait_Filro.png/25px-Portrait_Filro.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/29/Portrait_Filro.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Filro\" title=\"Filro\">Filro the Forgotten</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Dread_Hollow\" title=\"Dread Hollow\">Dread Hollow</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-60&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-160</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Scattered notes are scrawled by a chaotic hand.]\n</p><p><br>\nProtector... <a href=\"/wiki/Grym\" title=\"Grym\">guardian</a> of the Adamantine Forge? From magma rose, only in magma destroyed. Hot. Hammer. HOT. HAMMER!\n</p><p><br>\nWHERE???\n</p><p><br>\n[A small map is drawn underneath, marked by numerous 'X'es. The following words are scratched beneath it:]\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Dhourn\" title=\"Dhourn\">DHOURN</a> KNOWS\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>There are three items that contain hints about the <a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Forge_(location)\" title=\"Adamantine Forge (location)\">Adamantine Forge</a> and advance the corresponding <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Forge_(quest)\" title=\"Adamantine Forge (quest)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"quest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Forge_(quest)\" title=\"Adamantine Forge (quest)\">quest</a>. Passing ability checks on all these three items grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sage#If_I_Can't_Have_It...\" title=\"Sage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"If I Can't Have It...\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Sage#If_I_Can't_Have_It...\" title=\"Sage\">If I Can't Have It...</a> inspiration to party members with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sage\" title=\"Sage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/20px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/30px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/40px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/20px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sage\" title=\"Sage\">Sage</a> background. The other two items are:\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Memory_Shard\" title=\"Memory Shard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Memory_Shard_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Memory_Shard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Memory_Shard_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Memory_Shard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Memory_Shard_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Memory_Shard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Memory_Shard_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Memory_Shard_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Memory_Shard_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Memory_Shard\" title=\"Memory Shard\">Memory Shard</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-ic